flowchart TD
    %% CoreBase SpecHarness Onboarding Flow — implementation authority:
    %% WORKFLOW.md §2–§3, starter-init/SKILL.md, install.sh, and cli.py init

    START([Untailored Project]) --> INST["install.sh<br/>Copies kit-owned overwrite files<br/>Seeds missing copyIfMissing files<br/>Runs installed doctor"]:::common
    INST --> INIT_CMD["python3 corebase-specharness/scripts/core/cli.py init<br/>Scaffolds missing directories and seed stubs<br/>Reports onboarding readiness and stack markers"]:::common
    INIT_CMD --> MODE{starter-init mode}:::decision

    MODE -->|fresh-init| FRESH["Empty or uninitialized workspace<br/>scaffold · archaeology sweep · memory pre-fill"]:::common
    MODE -->|resync-drift| RESYNC["harness-config.yaml already exists<br/>read-only archaeology diff<br/>do not overwrite adopter edits"]:::common

    FRESH --> DETECT
    RESYNC --> DETECT
    DETECT{Greenfield or Brownfield?}:::decision

    DETECT -->|Greenfield| GREEN["Greenfield<br/>Empty or kit-only repository"]:::green
    DETECT -->|Brownfield| BROWN["Brownfield<br/>Existing project code or tests"]:::brown

    GREEN --> GINIT["/starter-init Phase B<br/>Configure core-policies.md and project descriptors"]:::green
    GINIT --> GMEM["Customize memory files and confirm native commands"]:::green
    GMEM --> GFEAT["Pick first feature<br/>Route to /spec-requirements"]:::green

    BROWN --> BARCH["/starter-init Phase A<br/>Read-only archaeology sweep via subagents<br/>Writes stack, architecture, policies, and preserved baselines"]:::brown
    BARCH --> BINIT["/starter-init Phase B<br/>Customize core-policies.md and project facts<br/>Record baseline test commands"]:::brown
    BINIT --> BSAFE["Pick small, safe first feature<br/>Route to /spec-research if behavior unknown"]:::brown

    GFEAT --> LOOP[Standard direct-skill delivery loop]:::common
    BSAFE --> LOOP
    LOOP --> SHIP([Shipped feature + KB compounded]):::terminal

    classDef terminal fill:#0d0d0d,stroke:#0d0d0d,color:#fff
    classDef green fill:#ebf7f2,stroke:#10b981,color:#065f46
    classDef brown fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#92400e
    classDef common fill:#fff,stroke:#d0d7de,color:#0d0d0d
    classDef decision fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#0d0d0d

    class START,SHIP terminal
